# November 19, 2026: central Orange County, New York: the Town of Montgomery (Montgomery village, Walden, Coldenham),
# Hamptonburgh and Campbell Hall, Goshen, Washingtonville, Vails Gate and New Windsor, the Town of Newburgh and the city
# of Newburgh's headquarters. Drawn at random by tools/choose.py --state ny (region midh; it offered Montgomery, where the
# Atlas had nothing within 20 km). Sources opened in this session: Wikipedia as raw text (tools/wiki_raw.py), NYS Parks,
# Orange County tourism (pickocny.com), the Times Hudson Valley, The Clio, HMdb marker pages, the Harness Racing Museum,
# Brotherhood Winery, the Bull Stone House Association, the Historical Society of Walden, the Town of New Windsor and
# Chronogram, through tools/page.py. orangecountygov.com (the county's own park and museum pages) answered HTTP 403.
